  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introduction to pdfio</title>

    <para>
      The <application>pdfio</application> package contains 
      a simple C library for reading and writing PDF files.
    </para>

    &lfs130_checked;

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Package Information</bridgehead>
